---
description: Keep scripts, scenes, and assets in separate folders
alwaysApply: true
---

# Project folders

```
res://
  scripts/   # all .gd (game + tests)
  scenes/    # all .tscn
  assets/    # art, audio, fonts, debug dumps
    fonts/
    textures/
    debug/
  addons/    # plugins only
```

- Never put `.gd` next to `.tscn` in the same feature folder
- Scenes reference scripts via `res://scripts/...`
- Do not add `actors/`, `tests/` as top-level mixed folders
